Windows port modifications:
Modification date: 2026-09-12
Port: Windows (x64; .NET 9, WinForms + WebView2)
Changes: the ATVV voice protocol state machine and the IMA-ADPCM decoder were
re-implemented in C# from the macOS sources; audio output uses NAudio WASAPI
instead of the CoreAudio virtual microphone driver; RC003-MS device identity is
established through WinRT GATT (DIS / PnP) and Raw Input; a low-level keyboard
hook intercepts the remote's native keys and injects mapped target keys through
SendInput; a three-mode voice-key shortcut controller (tap-toggle /
hold-with-auto-stop / hold) replaces the software-Fn presets; a WebView2 based
mapping and settings UI replaces the native macOS UI; a per-user Inno Setup
installer replaces the PKG installer.
The OpenRemoteAudio CoreAudio driver is NOT part of the Windows port and no
driver source from this project is redistributed in the Windows build.

Publication packaging modifications: 2026-09-14
